cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ClownID, please cite it as below. It was co-created with generative AI; see the README's 'Credits and AI disclosure'."
type: software
title: "ClownID: an object-ID (clown) pass for Rhino 8"
version: 0.9.3-beta
date-released: 2026-10-21
authors:
  - alias: adpchrgruber
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/adpchrgruber/ClownID_Rh8"
abstract: >-
  Rhino 8 plug-in that draws every object in one flat, unlit colour derived from its id
  and exports the view as a clean mask with a JSON colour key, for compositing renders.
  Developed with generative AI assistance (Claude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code, Anthropic),
  directed, reviewed and tested by the author.
keywords:
  - Rhino
  - RhinoCommon
  - clown pass
  - object ID
  - mask
  - compositing
references:
